      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Frenetic Assault",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "1 to 3\n\nFrequency once per round\n\n---\nEffect The members of the brigade wildly swing their weapons-primarily spears-in a frenzied attack at each enemy adjacent to the troop (DC 29 basic Reflex save save). The damage depends on the number of actions.\n\n1 1d12+1 piercing damage\n\n2 2d12+11 piercing damage\n\n3 3d12+11 piercing damage",
      "frequency": {
        "max": 1,
        "per": "round"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Troop Movement",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Whenever the troop Strides, they first Form Up as a free action to condense into a 20-foot-by-20-foot area (minus any missing squares), then move up to their Speed. This works just like a Gargantuan creature moving; for instance, if any square of the troop enters difficult terrain, the extra movement cost applies to the whole troop."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Troop Spellcasting",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "When the sun warrior brigade Casts a Spell, its constituent members combine their efforts into casting a more powerful version of the spell than any one member could achieve alone. When Casting a Spell that has an area of a burst, cone, or line and doesn't have a duration, increase the area of that spell. Add 5 feet to the radius of a burst that normally has a radius of at least 10 feet (a burst with a smaller radius is not affected). Add 5 feet to the length of a cone or line that is normally 15 feet long or smaller, and add 10 feet to the length of a larger cone or line.",
